{"t":"Umbral Creation","s":"umbral-creation-e062b","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Umbral_items_e76901.png","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"umbral creation steps\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"413\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Umbral_items_e76901.png\" width=\"370\"/><figcaption>umbral creation steps</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Umbral Creation</b> is a technique, introduced in the Winter Update 2013 which enables characters to create, improve and transform certain Clubs, Swords, Axes, Fist Fighting Weapons, Spellbooks, Bows, and Crossbows.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-The_process\">The process</span></h2>\n<p>The process consists of <b>creating</b>, <b>improving</b> and <b>transformation</b>, requiring one Dream Matter and 245 <a href=\"#/wiki/Cluster%20of%20Solace\">Clusters of Solace</a> at minimum. On average, 12.7 Dream Matter and 2100 <a href=\"#/wiki/Cluster%20of%20Solace\">Clusters of Solace</a> are spent on creating an umbral master item, according to Umbral Creation/Statistics. However, before you can use these, your world needs to have killed <a href=\"#/wiki/Gaz%27haragoth\">Gaz'haragoth</a>, after which <a href=\"#/wiki/Eruaran\">Eruaran</a> will appear in <a href=\"#/wiki/Upper%20Roshamuul\">Upper Roshamuul</a>. He is the only one who knows what to do with these items.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creating\">Creating</span></h3>\n<p>To create a crude umbral piece - blade, slayer, axe, chopper, mace, hammer, katar, bow, crossbow, or spellbook - bring <a href=\"#/wiki/Eruaran\">Eruaran</a> a Dream Matter and 20 <a href=\"#/wiki/Cluster%20of%20Solace\">Clusters of Solace</a>. You can choose any weapon type, no matter your vocation.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Improving\">Improving</span></h3>\n<p>The improving step depends on the item you bring. Unlike the first step, no dream matter is required here. Only your crude umbral piece and 75 <a href=\"#/wiki/Cluster%20of%20Solace\">Clusters of Solace</a> are required to improve your item to umbral state. The chance of failing is higher here, and if so you will lose either your crude piece and keep your Clusters or keep your weapon but lose all the required Clusters.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transformation\">Transformation</span></h3>\n<p>The transformation step is the most valuable one and will take some effort, but the outcome is tremendous. Bring your umbral equipment piece and 150 <a href=\"#/wiki/Cluster%20of%20Solace\">Clusters of Solace</a> in order to transform them to master state. If you are unlucky the following things may occur: you lose your umbral item and keep all Clusters or your umbral item is downgraded to a crude umbral item and you lose half of your Clusters (75).\n</p><p>The outcome of each single step is permanent.\n</p><p><span style=\"line-height: 20px; margin-top: 13px;\"><i> <b>See also:</b> Umbral Creation/Statistics </i> </span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Items\">Items</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Distance Weapons</caption><tbody><tr>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th></th>\n<th style=\"text-align: center;\">Attributes</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: center;\">Weight (oz)</th>\n<th>Dropped By</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Crude Umbral Crossbow</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Crude Umbral Crossbow\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Crude_Umbral_Crossbow_8b9192.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Range: 5</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\" style=\"text-align: center;\">130.00</td>\n<td><div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\"><div class=\"div-creature-list-generic creature-table\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gaz%27haragoth\">Gaz'haragoth</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div> </div></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td>Umbral Crossbow</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Umbral Crossbow\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Umbral_Crossbow_323b54.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Range: 5</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\" style=\"text-align: center;\">125.00</td>\n<td><div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\"><div class=\"div-creature-list-generic creature-table\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gaz%27haragoth\">Gaz'haragoth</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div> </div></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td>Umbral Master Crossbow</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Umbral Master Crossbow\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Umbral_Master_Crossbow_23c030.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Range: 5, distance fighting +3</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\" style=\"text-align: center;\">120.00</td>\n<td><div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\"><div class=\"div-creature-list-generic creature-table\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gaz%27haragoth\">Gaz'haragoth</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div> </div></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td>Crude Umbral Bow</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Crude Umbral Bow\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Crude_Umbral_Bow_4b8a41.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Range: 7</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\" style=\"text-align: center;\">50.00</td>\n<td><div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\"><div class=\"div-creature-li